# The backend loads backend/.env; Vite loads frontend/.env.
# Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env for backend configuration.
# This root file is a directory of supported values, not an auto-loaded runtime file.
# Backend / Vercel: NODE_ENV, CLIENT_ORIGIN, DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET,
# JWT_EXPIRES_IN, TRUST_PROXY; optional LLM_PROVIDER, GEMINI_API_KEY, GEMINI_MODEL,
# or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and ANTHROPIC_MODEL for the existing provider.
# Local SQLite only: DATABASE_PATH, ALLOW_PROTECTED_DATABASE, PORT.
# Frontend public value only; same-origin /api is the deployment default.
VITE_API_URL=/api
